      "signpost": null,
      "definition": "added to a verb or noun to mean done badly, wrongly, or by mistake",
      "explanation": "**Mis-** is added to verbs (*mishear*, *misplace*, *misjudge*) and to nouns, including nouns made from verbs (*misunderstanding*, *misbehavior*, *misconduct*).",
      "grammar": {
        "countability": null,
        "transitivity": null,
